summary:
  A check that comes right after a fall passes its verdict before the knock could be answered.

history:
  The heal road knocks 2.5 s after a stream is taken for dead, and on the
  bench the first sound came 1.25 s after the request. A station that fell
  22 s after the fire has its first check 3 s later: without the wait the
  tone replaces a station that would have been back within the second.

target:
  package/contents/ui/AlarmEngine.qml

find:
              if (wait > 0) {

replace:
              if (wait > 8000) {

expect:
  Killed by tst_alarmengine::test_a_check_that_comes_before_the_knock_had_its_time_waits_for_it.
  Line-neutral.
